  # has to be. -ona is open often enough to look like a rule -- dona, bona,
  # mona -- and it is not one: Barcelona, persona, corona and estona are all
  # close, and Barcelona is in the cases. So the arm asks which word it is,
  # and a word is added to it by adding a letter here. -on is the same story
  # from the other side: bon is open where son and front are close.
  plant test close
  call ZZlpta_load__setscan_r__1 addr right
